### listando produtos
GET http://localhost:8080/produtos
Accept: application/json

### cadastrando mouse com foto
POST http://localhost:8080/produtos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MTU5MjAxOCwiZXhwIjoxNzkxNjc4NDE4fQ.EGMbRaKladJPMYW9l4METFBV4KOuo3M_znHjlWZZ-0o
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="produto"; filename="produto.json"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Mouse",
  "preco": 10,
  "categoria": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="foto"; filename="mouse.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:\Users\aluno\Downloads\mouse.png
--WebAppBoundary--



